    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24051" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insulsĭtas</span></b> ,
		ātis, f.
		insulsus. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>tastelessness</i>, <i>insipidity</i>,
				<i>silliness</i>, <i>absurdity</i>
			(class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insipientia insulsitasque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 3, 3, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">villae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 13, 29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">harum rerum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 5, 11</span></i>
			
			<i>init.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Graecorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Rab. Post. 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orationis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Brut. 82, 284</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Quint. 5, 13, 38</span></i>.</div>
